# Inventory Domain

Applies to `domains/inventory/` and `presentation/inventory/`.

## Ownership

- Inventory grid state and slot validation
- Per-class equipment slots (`serializar_equipamentos`)
- Warehouse tabs and unlock sync with skill tree
- Forge rules: synthesis, dismantle, gem imbue (`ForgePanel` logic extracted to domain)

## Must NOT

- Build or style `Control` nodes (that is `presentation/inventory/`)
- Run combat timers or enemy logic
- Change gold balance silently — emit `gold_spent` / `gold_earned` or call GameState

## ItemData contract

- Persist via `para_dicionario()` / `de_dicionario()`
- New fields need defaults in `de_dicionario` and doc update in `save-format.md`
- Generated drop IDs use unique suffix (`Time.get_ticks_msec()`)

## Equipment rules

- Respect `ItemData.classe_requerida` and `Tipo` per slot
- Emit `equipamentos_alterados` / `equipment_changed` after valid equip
- Trigger stat recalc upstream (main/GameState), not inside slot widget

## External services

- `ItemDatabase` for catalog and random generation
- `SkillTreeProgress` for warehouse unlock indices

